    "scenario": "TerramEarth stores 100+ sensor metrics per vehicle (engine temperature, hydraulic pressure, vibration) sampled at 1Hz in Cloud Bigtable. Field engineers query the most recent 1 hour of telemetry for a specific vehicle during active field alerts, while data scientists run full-fleet scans across vehicle models. To prevent write hotspotting and optimize point queries for the latest data, how should you design the Bigtable row key?",
