      "B": "Disabling throttling allows scrapers and bots to saturate backend databases.",
      "C": "Rebooting gateways causes total service outages.",
      "D": "A monthly Quota policy does not prevent a user from sending all 10,000 requests in 1 second, crashing the backend."
