        "text": "Deploy Google Distributed Cloud (GDC) Edge or containerized edge runtime on ruggedized on-vehicle hardware running optimized TensorFlow Lite models locally, buffering telemetry locally and syncing to Cloud Storage via depot Wi-Fi.",
