    "title": "TerramEarth: Secure, Phased Over-the-Air (OTA) Firmware Rollouts",
    "scenario": "TerramEarth needs to distribute critical ECU firmware updates to 20 million vehicles globally. Updates must be cryptographically signed, downloaded only over verified depot Wi-Fi (to prevent cellular data charges), staged in a 1% -> 10% -> 100% canary deployment ring, and automatically halted if error rates exceed 0.05%. How should you architect the OTA delivery platform?",
