        "letter": "B",
        "text": "Deploy GKE Overprovisioning using low-priority 'Pause Pods' (using a PriorityClass with low priority value); when sudden production traffic surges arrive, high-priority user pods immediately preempt the pause pods and schedule in milliseconds, while Cluster Autoscaler provisions new nodes in the background to re-host the pause pods.",
