      "B": "Personal consumer accounts cannot be centrally managed or audited for HIPAA compliance.",
      "C": "A single monolithic project creates massive blast radiuses, hits project quota limits, and prevents least-privilege IAM boundaries.",
      "D": "Multiple independent Organizations prevent unified IAM governance, consolidated billing, and cross-project VPC controls."
